{"1933520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hero Mania", "steam_appid": 1933520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Mania</strong> is a chaotic, bombastic, 4-player action party game in which players don sparkling spandex of wacky, washed up, and eccentric powered heroes in an all-out brawl to win fame and glory -- oh, and to save the city of course!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Crime!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help citizens, and take down criminals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/10b8d526d951d5c4ea40ba815881bc98.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/10b8d526d951d5c4ea40ba815881bc98.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/10b8d526d951d5c4ea40ba815881bc98.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Using Incredibly Bizarre Super Powers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of 10 bizarre, silly, and understandably unacclaimed heroes each with their own oddball personalities, powers, and backstories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/c3154e23681bdc7bb9bf5ed4608fdc59.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/c3154e23681bdc7bb9bf5ed4608fdc59.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/c3154e23681bdc7bb9bf5ed4608fdc59.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw Your Friends!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment -- and each other -- to get the upper hand in a fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/e1ae13e3755b83d97cc175aa4690b652.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/e1ae13e3755b83d97cc175aa4690b652.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/e1ae13e3755b83d97cc175aa4690b652.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the City's Number One Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast, dash, and smash your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/485219062171cc8601baad8066212579.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/485219062171cc8601baad8066212579.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/485219062171cc8601baad8066212579.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player local multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add bots to fill out a group, or to create a common enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable heroes, each with their own unique super powers and play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 stages featuring unique themes, objectives, and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game modes with the freedom to customize the rules -- play your way!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Mania</strong> is a chaotic, bombastic, 4-player action party game in which players don sparkling spandex of wacky, washed up, and eccentric powered heroes in an all-out brawl to win fame and glory -- oh, and to save the city of course!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Crime!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help citizens, and take down criminals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/10b8d526d951d5c4ea40ba815881bc98.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/10b8d526d951d5c4ea40ba815881bc98.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/10b8d526d951d5c4ea40ba815881bc98.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Using Incredibly Bizarre Super Powers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of 10 bizarre, silly, and understandably unacclaimed heroes each with their own oddball personalities, powers, and backstories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/c3154e23681bdc7bb9bf5ed4608fdc59.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/c3154e23681bdc7bb9bf5ed4608fdc59.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/c3154e23681bdc7bb9bf5ed4608fdc59.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw Your Friends!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment -- and each other -- to get the upper hand in a fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/e1ae13e3755b83d97cc175aa4690b652.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/e1ae13e3755b83d97cc175aa4690b652.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/e1ae13e3755b83d97cc175aa4690b652.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the City's Number One Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast, dash, and smash your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/485219062171cc8601baad8066212579.poster.avif?t=1788116974\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/485219062171cc8601baad8066212579.webm?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/extras/485219062171cc8601baad8066212579.mp4?t=1788116974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player local multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add bots to fill out a group, or to create a common enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable heroes, each with their own unique super powers and play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 stages featuring unique themes, objectives, and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game modes with the freedom to customize the rules -- play your way!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Hero Mania is a chaotic, bombastic, 4-player action party game in which players don the spandex of wacky, washed up, and eccentric heroes as they brawl their way to fame and glory using their powers, abilities, environment, and even each other!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/header.jpg?t=1788116974", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/9a1e9c95144cbe97f34376b79f1756d2915dbc9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788116974", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933520/9a1e9c95144cbe97f34376b79f1756d2915dbc9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788116974", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.7 GHz Dual-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris 6100 Integrated Graphics or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum requiremen